# GKZB company Cursor rules - based on vendor-published domains.
# No generic AWS/CloudFront/Cloudflare suffixes: they also host other apps.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor.sh
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursorapi.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor-cdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursorvm.com
# Exact Cursor installer / agent artifact buckets, not generic s3 provider.
DOMAIN,anysphere-binaries.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,cloud-agent-artifacts.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
# Cursor new login flow: exact shared authentication hosts (can also serve Grok)
DOMAIN,accounts.x.ai
DOMAIN,accounts.spacex.ai
DOMAIN,auth.x.ai
DOMAIN,auth.grok.com
DOMAIN,auth.grokusercontent.com
DOMAIN,auth.grokipedia.com
